  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Noticed after new update to VRC. I load it up in desktop mode and my audio drops to 0 and I have to manually bring up the volume. If I click on a different application (ex. Discord) and I go back to bed, it drops it back to 0 and I have to manually bring it up again. I have yet to test to see if this issue happens in VR mode so I cannot confirm yet if it is a new VRC problem of if it is a realtek audio driver issue.",
